    b) Generate a response vector $Y$ of length $n = 100$ according to the model
        $$
        Y = \beta_0 + \beta_1 X + \beta_2 X^2 + \beta_3 X^3 + \epsilon
        $$
        where $\beta_0 = 1, \beta_1 = -0.5, \beta_2 = 2, \beta_3 = -1$.
        
```{r}
#set coeffs 
